      "content": "i get that it's \"documented\" but i feel like everyone i know takes herbal stuff with their meds and it's fine. i'm just really struggling with my mood right now and i don't think i can wait weeks for an appointment. if i just started with a really low dose, like maybe just a half dose of the supplement, would that be safer or would it still be a big risk? i just want something to help me get through the week.",
